                                                "sense_id": "8095772d-29be-3e2a-950e-2185806fac72",
                                                "text": "Following the sentencing, Knutton said: \"What sort of person does something so cold and calculating? I did not expect her to go to jail for it. I am just glad it is now all over.\""
                                            }
